    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash of Adventurers \u2122 is an Open World MMORPG developed by Devsland Soft, a studio incorporated to bring this project alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first Saga of Clash of Adventurers: 'Arrival of the Adventurers' is being developed using Unreal Engine 5 as Free To Play for PC Windows O.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental forces attempt to take over the lands of Lumeria, you will take part as an Adventurer to restore order and prevent the wild creatures from erasing the Human Race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adventurer you will be able to explore freely the lands of Lumeria and forge your own destiny, the only boundaries are your skills and abilities to survive in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaboration and coordination are key values, playing the role of an Attacker, Defender or Support you will have to join other Adventurers to complete Quests, unlock Achievements, defeat the fantastic creatures unleashed in Lumeria, and perhaps engage in battle against other Adventurers, much just like yourself, are shaping their own fate.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash of Adventurers \u2122 is an Open World MMORPG developed by Devsland Soft, a studio incorporated to bring this project alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first Saga of Clash of Adventurers: 'Arrival of the Adventurers' is being developed using Unreal Engine 5 as Free To Play for PC Windows O.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental forces attempt to take over the lands of Lumeria, you will take part as an Adventurer to restore order and prevent the wild creatures from erasing the Human Race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adventurer you will be able to explore freely the lands of Lumeria and forge your own destiny, the only boundaries are your skills and abilities to survive in the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaboration and coordination are key values, playing the role of an Attacker, Defender or Support you will have to join other Adventurers to complete Quests, unlock Achievements, defeat the fantastic creatures unleashed in Lumeria, and perhaps engage in battle against other Adventurers, much just like yourself, are shaping their own fate.</p>",
    "short_description": "Open World MMORPG, Free to Play, PvP, PvE, Craft, Trade, Quests, One class perform only one role (Attack, Defend or Support)",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Russian",
